# ── MARK LV — what never belongs in the repository ──────────────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run. A fresh clone with
# none of it present boots straight to the setup screen, which is the intended
# first experience — so nothing here needs to be committed, and some of it must
# never be.

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────
# API keys and plugin credentials
config/api_keys.json
# Dashboard TLS private keys and certificates
config/certs/
# Linked WhatsApp sessions
config/whatsapp_web/
# Google OAuth tokens and client secrets
**/token*.json
**/client_secret*.json
# Provider credentials
*credentials*.json

# User-specific state and caches
config/failure_memory.json
config/last_session_state.json
config/news_cache.json
config/owner_voice_profile.json
config/weather_cache.json
.env
.env.*

# ── Personal data and generated state ─────────────────────────────────────────
memory/*.json
memory/checkpoints/
memory/*.db
memory/artifacts/
memory/email_drafts/
memory/plugin_backups/

# ── Browser test profile and runtime cache ────────────────────────────────────
.edge_embed_test/

# ── Python build noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
downloads/
screenshots/

# Ruflo local secrets and runtime data
.env.local
.env.*.local
.claude-flow/data/
.claude-flow/logs/
.claude-flow/sessions/
